## Gyro Offset Correction

Measured stationary gyro offsets:
- gx_offset = -76.32
- gy_offset = 214.28
- gz_offset = -102.76

Correction method:
corrected = raw - offset

Result:
Corrected gyro values moved closer to zero while the IMU was stationary, confirming the bias correction step works.



