## Moving Average Filter: Gyroscope

Extended the moving average filter from gyro X to all three gyro axes.

Pipeline:
raw gyro → offset correction → ring buffer → moving average

Each gyro axis uses its own buffer, while all buffers share the same write index because each IMU sample updates gx, gy, and gz together.

Observation:
Filtered gyro values fluctuate less than corrected raw gyro values, but respond more slowly to sudden motion.
